## What you'll leave with

- **The loop, seen once end to end**, in a public repository you can go back and read: the demo's pull request, its review, and its history stay up at [github.com/prop-loft/prop-loft-demo](https://github.com/prop-loft/prop-loft-demo). The project itself lives at [github.com/prop-loft/prop-loft](https://github.com/prop-loft/prop-loft).
- **A working test for any commit message**: *"If applied, this commit will ___."*
- **A register for review comments**: what you see, why it matters, a question or a suggestion.
- **Wednesday's agenda**: the six decisions, ready to make for your own project.

